  <h2 class="module">Training Module 1 — Programming, Data and Artificial Intelligence Models</h2>
  <p><strong>Duration:</strong> 110 hours</p>
  <h3>Objective</h3>
  <p>Develop applications using Python in a data-analysis context while identifying different artificial intelligence systems.</p>
  <h3>Learning outcomes — knowledge, cognitive and practical skills</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>AI foundations:</strong> types of AI, AI applications, AI areas, and the role of data in AI.</li>
    <li><strong>Python and data tooling:</strong> Anaconda, Jupyter Notebooks, Python and advanced modules including NumPy, pandas, Matplotlib and scikit-learn.</li>
    <li><strong>Advanced data processing:</strong> structured/unstructured data; acquisition and storage; cleaning; enrichment; standardisation; 